  "body": "Import prepared effect and sound source data into the server package: 295 source-local observations plus one context record become 296 opaque Text reimport states. All previous 13 batches and 61 states are preserved; the package now contains 14 batches and 357 states. Retain exact replay evidence from 64 pinned Canary/Crystal source files.\n\nThe import uses the existing generic source-data contract and original server materializer. Native/canonical Item data, bindings, source owners, relations and World placement stay byte-identical. No effect execution, audio events, media assets or runtime readiness is claimed.\n\nValidation: 3 importer tests, 3 repository tests, 19 model tests, Clippy with warnings denied, formatting, 7 Python tests, exact replay and 17 content/source gates passed. The second original generation preserved all 11,929 files byte-for-byte. Prior 1,344 library tests (2 ignored) are reused against independently verified unchanged library/dependency/proof inputs. Independent source and final reviews passed. The historical test-only fixture failure and bounded repair remain recorded.\n\nDepends on #1562 and includes its published predecessor 4151e3005daa41ed848533e45b63fadc5ed78fa3. Exact-head CI, protected review and integration remain pending under the active control plane. This draft imports DATA and does not deploy a live server.",
